README.md
# Governance Score API

The Governance Score API calculates an institutional governance maturity score based on the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

It measures governance capability across multiple governance dimensions and produces a normalized governance score, maturity level, and improvement recommendations.

---

## Features

- Governance scoring
- Capability scoring
- Institutional maturity assessment
- Risk scoring
- Benchmark comparison
- Recommendation engine
- Dashboard-ready JSON output

---

## Governance Dimensions

- Accountability
- Transparency
- Rule of Law
- Coordination
- Institutional Memory
- Digital Governance
- Procurement Governance
- AI Governance
- Public Trust
- Capability

---

## Endpoints

POST /score

POST /benchmark

GET /metrics

GET /health
